ds, git_observation gained the non-executing observer's method and counts, and resource_observation gained the containment mechanism and the bounds the kernel actually enforced.  Every schema stays at Milestone 2 schema version 2; no Milestone 1 schema changed.","third_repair_schema_note":"The third critical-repair pass adds six private-workspace and trusted-export record types: source_snapshot_identity, private_execution_view_identity, proposed_export_change_set, export_reservation, export_receipt, and export_reconciliation.  Every schema stays at Milestone 2 schema version 2; no Milestone 1 schema changed."}